      "proposition": "The majority will hold that Section 2710(a)(1)'s goods or services need not be audiovisual: Congress expressly imposed a video-specific limitation in the separate definition of personally identifiable information but omitted it from the consumer definition, and the provider-source clause does not supply that missing limitation."
