    {
      "claim_id": "ground-breadth",
      "proposition": "The majority will announce a categorical rule that a qualifying consumer relationship may concern non-audiovisual goods or services, rather than an exception limited to this sports newsletter's connection to videos, while leaving provider status and qualifying personally identifiable information for further proceedings."
    }
